[en.FOCUS_C12_PIE_FAMILY_MEETING]
Family Meeting

[en.FOCUS_C12_PIE_FAMILY_MEETING_desc]
Maud Pie and Cheese Sandwich found the other members of the Pie family, and a small family meeting was about to commence. This gathering held the potential to completely transform the future landscape of the entire autonomous territory.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PIE_FAMILY_MEETING]
派家会议

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PIE_FAMILY_MEETING_desc]
石灰派和芝士三明治找到了派家庭的其他小马，一场小型的家庭会议即将召开，这也许会彻底改变未来整个自治领的面貌。

